  <metadata>
    <name>2027 Seoul Marathon - Full 42.195 km (approximate, based on the 2026 course)</name>
    <desc>APPROXIMATE track. The 2027 course map had not been published as of 2026-10-26, so this follows the 2026 course: route order from the official 2026 course map and the intersection-by-km table in the official 2026 traffic-control notice, routed along OpenStreetMap main roads, then shortened to the shortest line within 10 m of the road centreline (course-measurement style). ele = metres, digitised from the elevation chart on the official 2026 course map and lightly smoothed. Road data (c) OpenStreetMap contributors, ODbL.</desc>
  </metadata>
